# Motorhead body v1: Resonic (car 08), Base body (09-remaster 9.22 phase 6, #173). Game-space
# metres, x to the right, y up, z forward. Colours `r,g,b` are the MYO face tags before the
# repaint. Design choices unless marked [O].
#
# [O] cage 153 v / 171 p (150 welded), 4 open edges, none on more than 2 faces, 153/153 mirror
# twins; 66 edges under 10 deg, 31 at 10-20, 217 over 20; edge min 0.060 median 0.334 m. Box
# x +-1.046, y 0.271-1.164, z -1.919..1.927; hubs x +-0.75 (PhyWheel 0.6 x 1.25), z 1.05 / -1.3.
# A mid-engined wedge: paint 112 136 10 (71 faces) with the two-tone 227 191 0 (20: the sills
# 99/100, the nose 101/104, the hood stripe 139, the roof 95/96, the rear wing's deck 62/65/66,
# the bumper bar 158/162 and the mirror housings 12-19). The front arch tunnels are 11 11 11
# (21-40), the rear tunnels, the engine bay's walls and the bulkhead 41-43 are 1 1 1 (22 faces),
# the underside Underred (5 5 5). The engine between the haunches is a textured box (Enginea,
# 30 32 34: 8/9, 128-132, 147-156), kept as it is until the Full body, like the rear wing
# (62-68, 71/72) on its pylons. Stance kept as the original's (drop 0) for the first pass.
Body bevel=0.015 segments=3 bevel_tol=0.001 smooth_deg=10 arch_step_deg=7.5 arch_clearance=0.035 arch_lip=0.02 drop=0

# [O] the mirror faces are the white 255 255 255 quads 10/11 on the back of the housings
# (x 0.746-1.046, y 0.773-0.868, z 0.84-0.944)
MirrorGlass rgb=255,255,255

# [O] glass is 25 26 38 (10 faces, type 8/9: windscreen 79-81, side windows 84/85 and the
# rear quarters 82/83, rear window 86-88); the rest as the Titan's
Glass rgb=25,26,38 frame=0.02 inset=0.015 tint=0.6

# [O] headlights: one Redfjus quad a side, tag 127 127 127 (77/78, x 0.428-0.754, y 0.485-0.617,
# z 1.737-1.909, facing forward and a little out); halo 2/3 runs it from (0.754 0.566 1.747) to
# (0.428 0.513 1.900), rgb ff fb a8. Design choice: a reflector bowl with three bulbs along the
# slim lens and a daytime light bar along its bottom edge.
Lamp from=127,127,127 frame=0.008 inset=0.03 tint=0.45 kind=reflector count=3 rows=1 pitch=0 bulb=0.011 led_inset=0.03
Led pts=0,0;0.95,0 repeat=1 step=0,0 style=bar width=0.025 margin=0 clip=0 halo=1
# [O] tail lights: one Redpatbl quad a side, tag 123 9 0 (69/70, x 0.546-0.760, y 0.798-0.894,
# z -1.872, facing back, between the wing pylon and the haunch); halo 0/1 along it from
# (0.546 0.846 -1.871) to (0.760 0.835 -1.872), rgb ff 02 02. Design choice: a light tube round
# the lens and a bar through its middle (frame units = the lens's width, about 0.21 m).
Lamp from=123,9,0 frame=0.01 inset=0.02 tint=0.55 kind=leds led_inset=0.03
Led pts=0,0 repeat=1 step=0,0 style=rim width=0.015 gap=0.015 closed=1 margin=0 clip=0 halo=0
Led pts=0.05,0.23;0.95,0.23 repeat=1 step=0,0 style=bar width=0.025 margin=0 clip=0 halo=1

# [O] the lower rear panel 56 (1 1 1, |x| < 0.575, y 0.35-0.5, z -1.9..-1.775, facing back and
# down under the bumper bar). Design choice: a honeycomb mesh, like the Titan's rear panel.
Vent from=1,1,1 lo=0,0.33,-1.95 hi=0.6,0.52,-1.75 rgb=3,3,3 frame=0.01 inset=0.025 tint=0.5 kind=hex radius=0.012 wall=0.003 blades=0

# [O] The fenders are fans of flat facets: the front fender crown 111/112 (n 0.76 0.55 0.35)
# with 113/114 and 126/145 behind it (folded about 30 deg), 105/106 below; the rear haunch
# 119/137 (outer, near vertical), 121/140 (the rear slope), 123/142 and 124/143 (the top,
# n.y 0.96-0.98), 120/138 behind it; the haunch's inner top 122/141 runs on to the engine bay.
# Design choice (like the ASC's): each curved into one panel a side, 2.5 cm triangles, every
# point held to the original facets (`round`) so the bulge stays; the folds to the hood, the
# glass line, the yellow sills and the wing pylons stay creases.
Smooth from=112,136,10 lo=0.65,0.48,0.9 hi=1.0,0.95,1.8 max_deg=50 step=0.025 loose=0 round=0.1
Smooth from=112,136,10 lo=0.6,0.6,-1.9 hi=1.0,0.97,-0.5 max_deg=50 step=0.025 loose=0 round=0.1

# Every edge cut and every face remeshed at 4 cm, like the Titan and the ASC (#213, #172): the
# bevel strips' rows and the long fans over the big panels are slivers otherwise.
Refine step=0.04
